      "message": "refactor: implement mise for tool version management\n\n- Use mise to manage Ruby, Node.js, and Python versions\n- Extract static PATH from 'mise env' to avoid runtime overhead\n- Add entrypoint wrapper to source mise PATH in containers\n- Remove mise binary after build to prevent workspace .mise.toml detection\n- Fixes 'Argument list too long' error when mounting workspace",
